SUMMARY:The Barn Wreckers at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County’s own The Barn Wreckers bring a raw\, roots-driven sound that captures the spirit of Northern California’s live music scene. Featuring a tight-knit lineup including Hank Levine\, Ren Levine\, Leah Van Dyke\, and Phoebe Hastings\, the band blends Americana\, folk\, and rock influences into a sound that feels both homegrown and electrifying.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-barn-wreckers-at-rio-nido-roadhouse/
