DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission\nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird16 at checkout. Offer ends May 10th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nJoin us for a songwriter showcase featuring Norbay Award Winner Ellie James\, Ryan Woodard and Nicco Weisskoff performing in the round. Presented by Secret Song Club\, this show will be a fundraising party to benefit Redwood Empire Food Bank.\nhttps://www.thisiselliejames.com/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/thisiselliejames\nhttps://ryanwoodardmusic.com/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/ryanwoodardrocks/\nhttps://dogeardemos.bandcamp.com/
