SUMMARY:Sonoma Repair Fair + Clothing Swap
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in need of repair? \nBring it to the Repair Fair!‍ ‍ \nVolunteers and specialized repair professionals will be on-hand to repair* your items.  We ask that you stay with your item while it’s being fixed\, so you can learn tips for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods\, and even how to repair things yourself! \nIf you’d like to bring an item to repair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.org/rf-reg (Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!) \nThis is a free public event. \nThis event will also include a Clothing Swap. Please bring clothing items and accessories (clean and in good shape) to share and bring home something new to you! \n*We cannot guarantee your item(s) will be repaired\, depending on the existing damage or breakage\, ability of volunteer fixers\, and availability of materials for repair. Note: we cannot work on microwaves\, repair screens on cell phones/computer devices\, or perform any welding/brazing\, but we are happy to refer you to professionals who can. In addition\, the textile department is not able to perform the following: \nReplacing zippers \nRepairing shoes\, leather\, or vinyl materials \nPerforming alterations (making garments bigger/smaller) \nReplacing rivets/grommets \nHemming certain fabrics (stretchy fabric\, sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom dresses) \nIf you are in need of garment hemming\, we require that you please pin your garment to the desired length before you arrive. \nJoin Us!\nDoes fixing things sound like a fun way to spend a Saturday afternoon? Or want to help out in other ways? We need you! \nEmail volunteer@reusealliance.org or sign up here: https://www.reusealliance.org/rf-volunteer
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-repair-fair-clothing-swap/
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center\, 276 East Napa Street\, Sonoma\, 95476
CATEGORIES:Festival,Kids and Family,Other
GEO:38.2918;-122.453
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Sonoma Community Center 276 East Napa Street Sonoma 95476;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=276 East Napa Street:geo:-122.453,38.2918
END:VEVENT
