SUMMARY:Alaska Native Day
DESCRIPTION:The Alaska Native Community at Metini-Fort Ross welcomes all to Alaska Native Day May 16 & 17\, 2026 from 10 am – 4 pm. Please join us as we continue to honor our Alaskan Native history in the California lands of the Kashia Pomo. We will be celebrating our cultural practices through the sharing stories from our elders\, dance and crafts. Visit our website for more information: AlaskaNativeDay.com\n* The event is free but $10 State Park Parking fees are applicable *
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/alaska-native-day-2/
LOCATION:Metini-Fort Ross State Park\, 19005 Coast Highway 1\, Jenner\, 95450\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Dance Performance,Festival,Music
END:VEVENT
