DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 2nd Annual Battle of the Bands on Saturday\, May 16 from 12–5 PM at the Grinstead Amphitheater in Sonoma Plaza. This free\, family-friendly event features Northern California’s top middle and high school garage bands competing live for top prizes. Cheer on emerging talent\, soak up the energy\, and grab something delicious from The Butcherman food truck while you enjoy the show. It’s a day of great music\, great food\, and the next generation of artists in action.
