SUMMARY:Stomp Kings at Brewsters
DESCRIPTION:Brad Wilson and the Stomp Kings featuring Derek Irving\noriginated with Brad and Derek sitting in with each other’s bands. The synergy has been electrifying!\nThe Stomp Kings were born. \nLead singer\, Brad Wilson\, grew up in a musical family\, with his dad singing on the radio\, and his older brother\, Kim Wilson\, going forward to form The Fabulous Thunderbirds. It’s in the family. Brad’s velvety vocals pair well with Derek’s boss tone and expressive riffs. \nNational and international recording artist\, Derek Irving\, has played with many of the greats. A legend in his own right\, he shines on stage. His fluid guitar moves complement Brad’s stylin’ vocals and high-energy harmonica playing. \nAn accomplished and solid rhythm section\, with Andy Bergman and Mike Gutsch lays the foundation for some serious jump and jive. Let’s go! Some Rockabilly\, some Blues\, a few other things in between\, and a whole lotta fun.\nHold on to your hats for a rousing experience of lively music that will touch your soul\, and get you out on the dance floor.\nThis band is hot!! \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/stomp-kings-at-brewsters/
LOCATION:Brewsters Beer Garden\, 229 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.2366;-122.641
