SUMMARY:Graphic Medicine: Mom’s Cancer with Brian Fies
DESCRIPTION:Join award-winning cartoonist Brian Fies to celebrate the 20th anniversary of his groundbreaking graphic memoir\, Mom’s Cancer. Winner of the first-ever Eisner Award for Best Digital Comic\, Mom’s Cancer was the reason the category was created. It has been hailed as one of the 10 most important Eisner Award winners of all time by Comic Book Resources (CBR). Fies will talk about his work at 2:00 pm\, followed by a book signing.
