SUMMARY:The Petaluma Chorale Spring Concert Series - A Tapestry of Sound
DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Chorale Spring Concert Series – A Tapestry of Sound \nThe Petaluma Chorale is a mixed vocal ensemble dedicated to the art of superior choral singing\, including formal\, jazz\, Broadway and other contemporary styles. \nMade up of community members of all ages that share a love of singing. We work in 16 week sessions in the fall and spring culminating in at least two performances per session. We’d love for you to join us!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-petaluma-chorale-spring-concert-series-a-tapestry-of-sound/
