SUMMARY:Sonoma Valley Western Reserve Event At Wing & Barrel Ranch
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Valley Vintners & Growers Alliance\, a nonprofit supporting winemakers and grape growers in Sonoma Valley\, will host its first-annual Sonoma Valley Western Reserve at the exclusive Wing & Barrel Ranch for an unforgettable evening celebrating the intersection of world-class Sonoma Valley wine and authentic Western spirit. \nSip rare reserve labels poured by the vintners\, premium wines and signature cocktails\, live music\, and a ranch-style BBQ dinner. Proceeds benefit the Sonoma Valley Vintners & Growers Foundation. \nAdditionally\, guests can add sporting activities ($150-$250 each) such as clay shooting\, fishing\, casting\, and archery ahead of the main evening wine reception\, Western dinner\, and dancing. \nSchedule: \n3:00 – 5:00 p.m. – Sporting Activities: (advance purchase required) \n4:45 p.m. – VIP Wine Reception \n5:30 – 9:00 p.m. – Main Event \nSporting Activities require an add’l registration fee: \nClay Shooting: $250\, Fishing: $150\, and Archery: $150 \nLive music by Casual Country
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-valley-western-reserve-event-at-wing-barrel-ranch/
LOCATION:Wing and Barrel Ranch\, 6600 Noble Road\, Sonoma\, 95476
CATEGORIES:Other,Recreation
END:VEVENT
